<section class="legal">
  <h2>Your files stay on your device</h2>
  <p>Images, subtitles and other files you open in a tool are read and processed by your browser. They are never uploaded to a ReelFlow server. Tools that fetch a YouTube thumbnail request it directly from YouTube's public image servers.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
  <p>The site stores your cookie choice in your browser's local storage so the notice does not appear on every visit. No advertising or analytics scripts run until you accept them.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>If you accept the cookie notice and advertising is enabled, the site may load advertising scripts from Monetag to keep the tools free. Monetag may set its own cookies under its own policies. If you decline, no advertising scripts are loaded.</p>
  <p>The site also takes part in the Adsterra partner programme through its Smart Link product. An Adsterra link only opens when you choose to click it; it does not load automatically, and any cookies are set on Adsterra's side after you follow the link. Adsterra describes its data practices in its privacy policy at <a href="https://adsterra.com/privacy-policy-managed/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">adsterra.com</a>.</p>

  <h2>Push notifications</h2>
  <p>The site publishes a service worker at <code>/sw.js</code> for the Monetag advertising service. It only becomes active if you allow browser notifications for this site. You can revoke that permission at any time in your browser settings, or remove it by clearing this site's data. Push notifications are separate from the cookie notice, and your files are never sent through them.</p>

  <h2>Your choices and opt-out</h2>
  <p>You can change your cookie choice at any time. Changing it clears the saved choice and reloads the page so the notice asks again; ad scripts stay off until you accept. Clearing this site's data in your browser has the same effect. To stop push notifications, revoke this site's notification permission in your browser settings.</p>
  <p><button class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost" type="button" data-consent-reset hidden>Change cookie choice</button></p>
  <p>Advertising scripts are loaded from Monetag, whose cookies and data practices are described at <a href="https://monetag.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">monetag.com</a>. Adsterra links are opened only by your own click, and its data practices are described in its privacy policy at <a href="https://adsterra.com/privacy-policy-managed/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">adsterra.com</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions about this site, email <a href="mailto:kamran31367@gmail.com">kamran31367@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</section>
